<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><img id="imagen" src="10_Extra_Information_D_files/basecamp01.jpg" width="90%" onerror="this.style.display='none'" style="display: none;">                                                                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:16.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Various Roles<o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">In a transdisciplinary collaboration, you need to fill both existing and
new roles. These roles can change throughout the process. Possible roles
include:<o:p></o:p></span></p><ul style="margin-top:0cm" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
     font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Initiator<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
     font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Coordinator<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
     font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Networker<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
     font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Knowledge Connector<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
     font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Process Facilitator<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
     font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Expert<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
     font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Doer<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;
     font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">Connector<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:36.0pt"><span style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:
&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Tools and Tips:&nbsp;</span></b><b style="font-size: 1rem;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Involvement Matrix</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">The Involvement Matrix is a tool designed to facilitate discussions
about each individual's desired role in a (research) project. Originally
developed for collaboration with patients (a prime example of an ‘experts by
experience’ group), it can be applied more broadly in various contexts,
including your project.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-add-space:auto;
text-indent:-18.0pt;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo3"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:Wingdings;
mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">è<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">
</span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
