to a <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32550002/">publication about the
tool</a>, including the matrix [in English]<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:
14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:
EN-GB">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Additional Tips to Get to Know Each Other and Each
Other's Roles Better:</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style="margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.4;">

























</p><ul style="margin-top:0cm" type="disc">
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
     line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Get
     a Peek into Each Other's Work:</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;
     mso-ansi-language:EN-GB"> Spend a day with another team member to see what
     they do and what drives them (Van Bussel et al., 2018; Verkleij &amp;
     Francke, 2017; Wagemakers et al., 2024).<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
     line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Meet
     Formally and Informally:</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
     line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">
     Organize kick-offs, activity days, knowledge-sharing sessions, team
     activities, work meetings, app groups, or play a game to get to know each
     other in different ways.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
 <li class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0cm;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;
     tab-stops:list 36.0pt"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
     line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">Play
     a Role-Playing Game:</span></b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-size:14.0pt;
     line-height:116%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB">
     Step into a specific role and view a situation from that perspective.<o:p></o:p></span></li>
</ul>                                                                      </body></html>